### Lab 9 test requests (VS Code "REST Client" extension, or copy into Postman)

### List courses with their free seats
GET http://localhost:3000/courses

### A student's enrolments
GET http://localhost:3000/students/9/enrolments

### Exercise 2 - enrol student 9 in course 3
POST http://localhost:3000/students/9/enrolments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "course_id": 3 }

### Exercise 3 - cancel that enrolment
DELETE http://localhost:3000/students/9/enrolments/3

### Exercise 3 - cancel something that doesn't exist (expect 404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/students/9/enrolments/5

### Exercise 4 - student 999 does not exist (the INSERT fails -> rollback)
POST http://localhost:3000/students/999/enrolments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "course_id": 3 }

### Exercise 4 - duplicate enrolment: student 1 is already in course 1
POST http://localhost:3000/students/1/enrolments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "course_id": 1 }
